{
 "id": "story-oppvekkelsen-av-lasarus-gospel",
 "song": "/Users/vhanssen/WebstormProjects/flogvit/music/YuE/outputs/catalog/story-oppvekkelsen-av-lasarus-gospel",
 "offset_seconds": -3.7200000000001765,
 "words_heard": 213,
 "words": 218,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "In Bethany a man lay sick, the one the Lord held dear",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.08,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The sisters sent a message, Lord, the one you love is ill",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.14,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But four days in the tomb had passed before the Lord came near",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.09,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And Martha ran to meet him, while Mary stayed home still",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.28,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Lord, if you had been here, my brother would not have died",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.3,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Your brother will rise again, the Teacher answered her",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.12,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And when he saw them weeping, he was troubled deep inside",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.25,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Where have you laid him, he asked, and they said, come and see",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.21,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I am the resurrection and the life",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.41,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Whoever believes in me will live, even though he dies",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.31,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And everyone who lives and believes in me will never die",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.52,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Do you believe this",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 0.63,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Jesus wept",
   "heard": 2,
   "words": 2,
   "error_s": 0.23,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And they said, see how he loved him",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.14,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Take away the stone, he said, though four days had gone by",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.13,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He lifted up his eyes and thanked the Father in the sky",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.6,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Then he called out in a loud voice",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.84,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Lazarus, come out",
   "heard": 0,
   "words": 3,
   "error_s": null,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Lazarus, come out",
   "heard": 3,
   "words": 3,
   "error_s": 3.76,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Unbind him and let him go",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.91,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I am the resurrection and the life",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.35,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Whoever believes in me will live, even though he dies",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.3,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And everyone who lives and believes in me will never die",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.49,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Do you believe this",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 0.61,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Yes, Lord, I believe",
